{"ID":"20240513083428-7jpwkns","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083428-7jpwkns","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083428-7jpwkns\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513104014-1a7vldo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513104014-1a7vldo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:354,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513104014-1a7vldo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:465,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:541\u0026#125;","title":"029","type":"doc","updated":"20240515124434"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513104014-1a7vldo","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 929px;","id":"20240513104014-1a7vldo","updated":"20240515124434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪醫師病案紀錄    初診日期：20080313"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"014-08 C, M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"37歲，中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080418"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服前方後，"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 惡風仍有，覺身上的”進風口”變多，原來僅項後、腰後，現連命門處、膝、踝關節內側均有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→脾經，桂枝湯解肌健脾陽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 手仍涼"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 月經剛停"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 關節仍有一點痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 口唇乾，但體內不覺得渴"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 自覺體內溫度比體表低，且對外界溫度變化調整慢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 大便隔日一行"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→小腸(紅腸)擩動慢，非因津液不足(羊矢便)，且前方已令其溫度回，此為血不足，故要加當歸、木通"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 精力很差，總要睡"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. 說話稍多即累"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右脈微細"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→少陰證"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；左脈弦細"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：當歸四逆湯合麻黃附子細辛湯加減"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝六錢  白芍六錢  炙甘草五錢  大棗十枚  當歸三錢  木通三錢  細辛二錢(溫下焦陽)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白朮五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→去濕，合炙甘草、桂枝、炮附子為甘草附子湯，去風寒濕三痹"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子四錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→斂表陽，防麻黃宣肺發表太過"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→宣肺開表，肺主陽氣；此人肺氣不足，故欲寐 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各服一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"1. 麻黃附子細辛湯: 細辛溫下焦陽，小腸溫度一上升，氣化大腸中津液至肺，麻黃再將其宣發至表，炮附子同時固表，三藥合併另肺陽回頭，陽一回來，精神就好了!"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}